@startuml
title Sequence Diagram Konfirmasi Akun Guru (Tata Usaha)

actor "Tata Usaha" as TU
boundary "UI" as UI
control "Controller" as C
entity "Database" as DB

== Akses Halaman Konfirmasi ==
TU -> UI: 1. Akses menu "Konfirmasi Akun Guru"
UI -> C: 2. Request halaman konfirmasi
C -> DB: 3. Get data guru pending & confirmed
DB --> C: 4. Return data guru
C --> UI: 5. Load halaman konfirmasi
UI --> TU: 6. Tampilkan daftar guru

== Konfirmasi Akun Guru ==
TU -> UI: 7. Klik tombol "Konfirmasi" pada guru
UI -> C: 8. Request konfirmasi guru
alt Data Lengkap (NIK/NUPTK tersedia)
    C -> DB: 8.1. Update status guru ke "confirmed"
    DB --> C: 8.2. Success
    C -> DB: 8.3. Get updated data
    DB --> C: 8.4. Return updated data
    C --> UI: 8.5. Success response + refresh data
    UI --> TU: 8.6. Tampilkan notifikasi sukses & update tabel
else Data Tidak Lengkap
    C --> UI: 8.1. Error response
    UI --> TU: 8.2. Tampilkan pesan error
end

== Pencarian Guru ==
TU -> UI: 9. Input nama guru di search
UI -> C: 10. Request search
C -> DB: 11. Search guru by name
DB --> C: 12. Return search results
C --> UI: 13. Return filtered data
UI --> TU: 14. Tampilkan hasil pencarian

@enduml